+:: Mara Cafe Conversation
+<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<maraInit>>
+<<set _maraCafeTopic to random(1, 3)>>
+<<if _maraCafeTopic is 1>> /* Pets */
+	Mara's expression brightens when the conversation turns to her work. "I could talk about animals all day. There's something special about the way a nervous little creature gradually learns that it can trust you."
+	<br><br>
+	"The kittens are especially adorable when they tumble over their own paws, then look around as though they meant to do it. And the older dogs have such lovely personalities. They may take a little longer to warm up, but once they do, they're wonderfully affectionate."
+	<br><br>
+	Mara smiles into her cup. "I never get tired of seeing them find a home where they're loved. That's the best part of running the shop."
+<<elseif _maraCafeTopic is 2>> /* The player's life */
+	Mara rests her hands around her cup and looks at you with gentle curiosity. "I've told you plenty about the shop. I'd like to hear a little about you, too. How have things been going lately?"
+	<br><br>
+	You tell her a little about your recent days. She listens without interrupting, occasionally asking a thoughtful question and giving you time to answer.
+	<br><br>
+	"Thank you for telling me," she says. "It's easy to get caught up in our own routines. I think it's important to make time to hear how someone else is doing. I hope things become a little easier for you."
+<<else>> /* The weather */
+	Mara glances towards the cafe windows. "The weather has been rather changeable lately, hasn't it? I never know whether to bring a coat or leave it at home."
+	<br><br>
+	You exchange a few thoughts about the temperature, the clouds, and whether the next few days might bring clearer skies.
+	<br><br>
+	Mara gives a quiet laugh. "I suppose a little rain is good for the gardens, at least. Still, it's much nicer to enjoy it from somewhere warm with a cup of coffee."
+<</if>>
 <<set $mara.cafeChats += 1>><<npcincr Mara love 1>><<npcincr Mara trust 1>>
 <br><br>
 Reward:<<glove Mara>> | <<gtrust>>
